1313 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UI\057UX Designer \0505 years\051 delivering end\055to\055end product design across Maritime\054 AI\054 Cybersecurity\054 Healthcare\054 Education\054 ERP\054 Finance\054 Aviation\054 and Fintech\056 Started as a frontend developer\054 an early foundation that still shapes how I approach design today\056 That grew into a genuine focus on solving everyday problems for users\054 developing design systems\054 conducting user research\054 wireframing\054 prototyping\054 and usability testing\054 always aimed at turning something clunky into something intuitive\056 Along the way\054 I\047ve collaborated with international clients across Singapore and Australia\054 relearning new industry context again and again without losing the core design instinct underneath it\056 Proficient in Figma\054 Adobe Creative Suite\054 and front\055end technologies \050HTML\054 CSS\054 JS\051\054 with a focus on accessibility\054 consistency\054 and aligning user needs with business goals to deliver intuitive\054 high\055impact experiences\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 1314 0 R
     /Pg 1311 0 R
